  dialogue:
  - Dialogue: Now, have you come to help your Nanna clean the kitchen?
    Portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 5192d2ae68c371d4c88ca9a5e91ea005, type: 3}
  Charming_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Nooo!! Not the kitchen! Your mother is going to end us!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "I\u2019m going to destroy the kitchen...!"
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "Oh, a little help can go a long ways. Even if it\u2019s not much
        you\u2019re doing!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "No, you don\u2019t even need my help."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Expression:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "That\u2019s the spirit! It\u2019s more fun with help, anyways."
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah... I always like helping!
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 15
  Charming_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I suppose so... It\u2019s still nice to help your Nanna though!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Looks like you have most of it handled, Nanna!
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: "I suppose so... It\u2019s still nice to help your Nanna though!"
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "There doesn\u2019t look like much left to help with if I wanted
      to."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -5
  Sappy_Observation:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Yeah, your Nanna has most of it handled. You can still help a little
        though.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: "Sure, but there isn\u2019t much left to help with..."
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 10
  Charming_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh.. just cleaning. Gotta tidy up some of the fun!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Yeah, but what can Nanna not handle on her own?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: 5
  Assertive_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Oh.. just cleaning. Gotta tidy up some of the fun!
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: What're you even doing?
    RelationshipRequirement: 0
    AlternateBranch: {fileID: 0}
    ChangeInRelationshipStatus: -10
  Sappy_Question:
    NpcReactionText:
    - Dialogue: Yeah, your Nanna has most of it handled. You can still help a little
        though.
      Portrait: {fileID: 0}
    BranchingDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d0637f363470265408c3d82f41356184, type: 2}
    CombinedDialogue: []
    PlayerDialogue: Sure, but what would I even be able to help with..?
